      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近啊……野生的独角虫\n总是会大口地啃庭院里的树木……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD1554A2026202691CE751F768472EC89D2866B000A603B662F4F1A592753E3573055435EAD966291CC76846811672820262026001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且里面还有只\n大得离谱的头目独角虫。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我已经把它赶走很多次了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1491CC97628FD8670953EA000A59275F9779BB8C317684593476EE72EC89D2866B300200100001BE00000A62115DF27ECF628A5B838D768D705F88591A6B214E8620262026001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "莫非是我庭院里的树木\n都打理得太好了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83AB975E662F62115EAD966291CC768468116728000A90FD625374065F97592A597D4E86FF1F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果不是赶走，\n而是把头目独角虫捉住，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n其他独角虫说不定也就不来了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4E0D662F8D768D70FF0C000A800C662F628A593476EE72EC89D2866B63494F4FFF0C00100001BE00000A51764ED672EC89D2866B8BF44E0D5B9A4E5F5C314E0D67654E863002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托了！帮我捉住那只\n会在白天现身的头目独角虫吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584E86FF015E2E621163494F4F90A353EA000A4F1A5728767D592973B08EAB7684593476EE72EC89D2866B5427FF01FF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "独咿！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72EC54BFFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捉住那只头目独角虫吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63494F4F90A353EA593476EE72EC89D2866B5427FF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你大显身手，\n捉到头目独角虫了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F605927663E8EAB624BFF0C000A63495230593476EE72EC89D2866B4E863002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这下就不用再担心庭院里的树木了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E0B5C314E0D7528518D62C55FC35EAD966291CC7684681167284E8620262026001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说是放心了，可又感到有些寂寞。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n难道和独角虫们斗智斗勇\n已经成了我生活的意义所在了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF4662F653E5FC34E86FF0C53EF53C8611F523067094E9B5BC25BDE300200100001BE01000A96BE9053548C72EC89D2866B4EEC6597667A659752C7000A5DF27ECF62104E866211751F6D3B7684610F4E49624057284E86FF1F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位训练家，你不介意的话，\n能不能把头目独角虫让给我呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C4F604E0D4ECB610F76848BDDFF0C000A80FD4E0D80FD628A593476EE72EC89D2866B8BA97ED962115462FF1F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不行",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D884C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！重新一看，\n它的毒针好有气派啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF0191CD65B04E00770BFF0C000A5B8376846BD29488597D67096C146D3E554AFF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我和独角虫因为庭院里的树木起过争执，\n但这也说明我养的树木实在是太优质了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71366211548C72EC89D2866B56E04E3A5EAD966291CC7684681167288D778FC74E896267FF0C000A4F468FD94E5F8BF4660E6211517B7684681167285B9E5728662F592A4F188D284E86FF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今后我就用上等的叶子作为交换条件，\n请它帮我守护园子里的树木吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n谢谢你这位训练家啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA540E62115C3175284E0A7B49768453F65B504F5C4E3A4EA4636267614EF6FF0C000A8BF75B835E2E62115B8862A456ED5B5091CC7684681167285427FF0100100001BE00000A8C228C224F608FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB65566FF01001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说的也是。\n比起我这个园艺师，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n独角虫还是交给你这个训练家来照顾吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF476844E5F662F3002000A6BD48D7762118FD94E2A56ED827A5E08FF0C00100001BE00000A72EC89D2866B8FD8662F4EA47ED94F608FD94E2A8BAD7EC35BB667657167987E54273002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "头目独角虫来了以后，\n其他独角虫就销声匿迹了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "593476EE72EC89D2866B67654E864EE5540EFF0C000A51764ED672EC89D2866B5C31950058F0533F8FF94E863002001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "独咿！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72EC54BFFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "独角虫一切都好吗？\n没有乱吃其他人家的叶子吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72EC89D2866B4E00520790FD597D5417FF1F000A6CA167094E71540351764ED64EBA5BB6768453F65B505427FF1F001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
